      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6005201275139094163, guid: 39210a0dd84cf024989470efd9a33eae, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Past, present, future... What does this place truly mean to people?\n\n'Meet
        Me in the Cathedral' is an augmented reality experience that explores what
        this living heritage means to the people of Christchurch\u2014whoever they
        are, and wherever they come from.\n\nA lost traveler, a former choir member,
        a foreign visitor... Piece by piece, their personal stories weave together
        the fabric of this special place. As you trace the panel fence, you will
        encounter them, gently uncovering the quiet memories and meanings the Cathedral
        holds in their hearts."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6005201275139094163, guid: 39210a0dd84cf024989470efd9a33eae, type: 3}
